# Fate of the Sun-Cryst: "This spell costs {2} less to cast if it targets a tapped creature. Destroy target nonland permanent." Bot2's
# Mox Jet is tapped on turn 5 and so is the Ornithopter that attacked on turn 4; the second Ornithopter is untapped. Bot1 has three
# sources, so the full {4}{W} is out of reach: the cast at the untapped Ornithopter and at the tapped Mox (a permanent, not a creature)
# are refused. The cast at the tapped Ornithopter costs {2}{W}, empties the pool, and destroys it.

